SUMMARY:UC Davis Arboretum Clearance Plant Sale
DESCRIPTION:Last sale until spring: All plants 20% off! \nJoin us Saturday\, Nov. 14\, from 9 a.m.–1 p.m. at the Arboretum Teaching Nursery\, 1046 Garrod Dr.\, Davis. Everyone is welcome! All plants will be marked down 20%\, and Friends members save an additional 10%. \nHelp us celebrate the UC Davis Arboretum and Public Garden’s 90th anniversary while finding a few new favorites for your garden or home. We still have an incredible selection of attractive\, low-water plants perfect for our region. No yard? No problem! We also have a great selection of houseplants. \nYour purchases support our gardens\, student environmental leadership opportunities and free public programs. \nExplore the inventory and plan your visit.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/uc-davis-arboretum-clearance-plant-sale/
LOCATION:Arboretum Teaching Nursery\, 1046 Garrod Dr.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/plant-sale.jpg
END:VEVENT
