SUMMARY:Davis Odd Fellows Classic Film Fest: What's Up\, Doc?
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T130000
UID:10002213-1794767400-1794776400@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:The Davis Odd Fellows Classic Film Fest wraps up its three-wee
 k celebration of screwball comedies with What’s Up\, Doc? (1972)\, starr
 ing Barbra Streisand and Ryan O’Neal! \nDirected by Peter Bogdanovich\, 
 this hilarious comedy of mistaken identities\, mixed-up luggage\, and unex
 pected romance takes audiences on a wild adventure through San Francisco. 
 \nDavis Enterprise film critic Derrick Bang will introduce the movie with 
 entertaining background details and film insights\, followed by a Q&A afte
 r the screening. Enjoy live music by According to Bazooka before the film.
  \nAdmission and popcorn are FREE! Donations are welcome\, and the bar wil
 l be open for beverage purchases. \nDoors open at 6:29 PM\, with the movie
  beginning at 7:01 PM. Don’t miss the final screening of this classic co
 medy series!
LOCATION:Davis Odd Fellows\, 415 2nd St.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United Sta
 tes
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/davis-odd-fellows-classic-film-fest-wh
 atsup-doc/
