BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"UC Davis Library": "https://events.library.ucdavis.edu/event/what-work-looks-like-2026-11"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ucdavis_library
SUMMARY:What Work Looks Like: Campus to Career Conversations with UC Davis
  Alumni
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T160000
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54410879218346
DESCRIPTION:Between headline-grabbing shift in hiring\, changing entry-lev
 el roles\, and the sudden rise of genAI tool integration into the workplac
 e\, breaking into the workforce can feel uniquely daunting right now. \n\n
  \n\nJoin us to hear from recent UC Davis alumni about thier path from deg
 ree to first job\, how their day-to-day workflows are changing with emergi
 ng tech integrations\, and what strategies they use to continue to succeed
 . From breaking through crowded applicant pools to adapting to workplaces 
 re-shaped by emerging tech\, our speakers share their stories on what it r
 eally takes to launch and build careers in data\, software\, analytics\, d
 ata science and other fields today in industry\, government and academia. 
 Discover current opportunities at the alumni's workplaces\, UC Davis\, and
  beyond to grow your skills and gain hands-on experience.\n\n \n\nBring yo
 ur questions to ask our alumni after the hosted interview. Stick around af
 ter the session for refreshments and networking.\n\nThese events are desig
 ned for current UC Davis undergraduates\, but are open to all UC Davis stu
 dents. For those who are unable to attend in person\, register for a Zoom 
 link to listen in.\n\n \n\nNovember 17 Alumni Speaker - Federico Aprile \n
 \nFederico graduated in 2026 with a B.S. in Computational Cognitive Scienc
 e and minor in Data in Society.\nHe is currently an analyst at the UCSF Ba
 kar Computational Health Sciences Institute.\n\n--\n\nWhat Work Looks Like
  events are hosted by DataLab in collaboration with the Internship and Car
 eer Center.
LOCATION:Shields Library\, 360
URL:https://events.library.ucdavis.edu/event/what-work-looks-like-2026-11
X-SOURCE:UC Davis Library
END:VEVENT
