SUMMARY:Discovery Christian Church: Friendsgiving
DESCRIPTION:Discovery Christian Church invites community members to a Friendsgiving dinner on Saturday\, November 21\, from 6:00 to 8:30 p.m. at Discovery Hub\, 604 3rd Street\, Suite 100\, Davis\, CA 95616. The gathering welcomes unhoused neighbors to share a meal and celebrate the holiday season together. \nParticipants are encouraged to bring a favorite dish to share and invite friends to join in an evening of food\, connection\, and community. Register for the event through this link.
