DESCRIPTION:Join the Woodland Visibility Brigade to make the Resistance VI
 SIBLE! We resist the authoritarian and fascist administration with a topic
 al message and publicize upcoming local resistance events. We dance and wa
 ve and get lots of friendly honks! You will receive an immediate confirmat
 ion email with parking and location details\, and a reminder one hour befo
 rehand. Please make sure you know where you're headed before you set out!
LOCATION:Sports Park Bridge\, Woodland\, CA\, 95776
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisibleyolo/event/782287/
